# TDD Workflow

1. Write failing tests first (Red)
2. Implement minimum code to pass (Green)
3. Refactor while keeping tests green
4. Run `pnpm test:coverage` before marking work complete

Coverage minimums: shared 90%, api 85%, web 80%, overall 85%.
